12. The Rust crates in Cargo.lock
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This section is generated: `cargo run -p notices` writes it with cargo-about
(https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-about) from the crates' own licence
files, as set in tools/notices/about.toml.

The Rust crates that Lemon Studio, its plugins and its tools are built with, on
Windows, macOS and Linux, each with the licence it declares. Where a crate
offers a choice, the text below is of the licence Lemon Studio takes it under.
Crates that only run while building (build scripts and their libraries) are
listed too.

